{"id":"12ff4099e35b4ab6","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-thm-adams-spectral-sequence.md","title":"Adams Spectral Sequence","display":"thm-adams-spectral-sequence — Adams Spectral Sequence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-adams-spectral-sequence","aliases":["58-thm-adams-spectral-sequence"],"display":"thm-adams-spectral-sequence — Adams Spectral Sequence","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-ext.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-spectral-sequence.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-steenrod-algebra.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-adams-spectral-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-adams-spectral-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-adams-spectral-sequence — Adams Spectral Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7c0eb208441d0c3e\" href=\"?note=7c0eb208441d0c3e\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-ext.md\">../batch20/58-df-ext.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55d04ac829aa6988\" href=\"?note=55d04ac829aa6988\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-spectral-sequence.md\">../batch04/58-df-spectral-sequence.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3f3e7eea5614d92a\" href=\"?note=3f3e7eea5614d92a\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-steenrod-algebra.md\">../batch20/58-df-steenrod-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c682c089b3ac3182\" href=\"?note=c682c089b3ac3182\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md\">../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> (固定素数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(E_r^{s,t},d_r)\">\\((E_r^{s,t},d_r)\\)</span> (经典 mod-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> Adams 谱序列)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_p\">\\(\\mathcal A_p\\)</span> (mod-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> Steenrod 代数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3f3e7eea5614d92a\" href=\"?note=3f3e7eea5614d92a\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-steenrod-algebra.md\">../batch20/58-df-steenrod-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}^{s,t}_{\\mathcal A_p}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ext}^{s,t}_{\\mathcal A_p}\\)</span> (Steenrod 代数模范畴中的双分次 Ext)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_*^S\">\\(\\pi_*^S\\)</span> (球谱的稳定同伦群, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c682c089b3ac3182\" href=\"?note=c682c089b3ac3182\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md\">../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}adams\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\nE_2^{s,t}\\cong\n\\operatorname{Ext}^{s,t}_{\\mathcal A_p}(\\mathbb F_p,\\mathbb F_p)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\pi_{t-s}^{S}\\bigr)^{\\wedge}_p\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}adams\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\nE_2^{s,t}\\cong\n\\operatorname{Ext}^{s,t}_{\\mathcal A_p}(\\mathbb F_p,\\mathbb F_p)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\pi_{t-s}^{S}\\bigr)^{\\wedge}_p\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Assertion 采用球谱这一无歧义的经典特例；一般映射谱版本需要对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 明写连通性、有限型与收敛假设。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_0^S(S^0)\\cong\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\pi_0^S(S^0)\\cong\\mathbb Z\\)</span>，不是原文件所写的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z/2\">\\(\\mathbb Z/2\\)</span>；Hopf invariant one 问题涉及其他茎。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_r^{s,t}: E_r^{s,t} \\to E_r^{s+r, t+r-1}\">\\(d_r^{s,t}: E_r^{s,t} \\to E_r^{s+r, t+r-1}\\)</span> in the Adams indexing convention.</li>\n<li>Higher differentials determined by known operations.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-ext.md","status":"resolved","id":"7c0eb208441d0c3e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-ext.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-spectral-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"55d04ac829aa6988","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-spectral-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-steenrod-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"3f3e7eea5614d92a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-steenrod-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"c682c089b3ac3182","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-steenrod-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"3f3e7eea5614d92a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal A_p$ (mod-$p$ Steenrod 代数, see [[../batch20/58-df-steenrod-algebra.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"c682c089b3ac3182","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\pi_*^S$ (球谱的稳定同伦群, see [[../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p","display":false},{"